                "Definition: electronegativity",
                "The ΔEN rule"
              ],
              "notes": [
                {
                  "prompt": "Electronegativity (EN):",
                  "answer": "how strongly an atom pulls on shared electrons."
                },
                {
                  "prompt": "ΔEN =",
